group: {sg_prim}\"\n\n# Save the primitive cell as the canonical base structure for downstream steps\nfrom ase.io import write\nwrite('structures/TiO2_primitive.cif', prim)\nprint(f\"Saved primitive cell to structures/TiO2_primitive.cif\")\nprint(f\"Path: {res['path']}\")\nprint(f\"Point coords: {res['point_coords']}\")\n"
